   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Find the action and the condition",
     "texto": [
      "Instructions often use an **usted command**: **Desenchufe** el aparato. A negative command gives a **prohibition**: **No lo use** cerca del agua.\n\nNotice the words that set the order or the condition:\n\n- **antes de** + infinitive: **antes de** limpiarlo.\n- **después de** + infinitive: **después de** limpiarlo.\n- **si** + present: **si** el cable está dañado, no lo use.\n\nThe texts in this lesson are invented practice, not real labels."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "gramatica",
     "titulo": "Commands, antes de and después de",
     "texto": [
      "To give an order to **usted** you use the command: **desenchufe**, **use**, **consulte**. To forbid, add **no**: **no use**, **no encienda**.\n\nThe pronoun is **attached** to the affirmative command (**déjelo** secar) and **before** the negative (**no lo use**).\n\nTo order the steps:\n\n- **antes de** + infinitive: **antes de** limpiar el aparato, desenchúfelo.\n- **después de** + infinitive: **después de** limpiarlo, déjelo secar."
     ],
